# Only the optimised delivery copy reaches Vercel. vercel.json serves dist/MTG2A04_L01_S01/
# (index.html at its root), so everything else in this repo is authoring material: the working
# build with raw-WAV audio and full-size PNGs (~55 MB), the engine sources, the build scripts,
# the SME decks, the review screenshots and the first draft. Left in, they would be uploaded on
# every deploy for nothing.
#
# Rebuild dist/ with `python scripts/make_dist.py` BEFORE pushing, or Vercel serves the old game.

/*
!/dist
!/vercel.json
